# Planet / flora gotchas

- Characters/enemies: local **+Y** = away from planet center (`FromToRotation(Vector3.up, radial)` / `LookRotation(tangent, gravityUp)`).
- Kenney grass clumps are often modeled **flat in XZ** (thin on Y) — use surface-normal align, not “lay flat” tip, or they stand on edge.
- Prefer planet APIs (`GetBiomeColorAtPosition`, foliage greenness) over inventing color heuristics.
- Heavy flora: avoid spawning tens of thousands of GameObjects; GPU instancing / carpets when density is the goal.
